WEBVTT

00:24:59.289 --> 00:25:02.271
and wanting to just kind of
allot your social energies

00:25:02.295 --> 00:25:05.755
in very different ways
from what might be conventional.

00:25:05.779 --> 00:25:07.570
CA: I mean, if you're running an org

00:25:07.594 --> 00:25:11.687
and you wanted to boost
introvert-powered leaders,

00:25:11.711 --> 00:25:13.760
how would you even identify them?

00:25:14.503 --> 00:25:18.996
SC: Yeah, what I always say
to companies when I go in,

00:25:19.020 --> 00:25:23.417
is that every single person
should be thinking of some --

00:25:23.441 --> 00:25:26.845
just pick one person
who you know in your company,

00:25:26.869 --> 00:25:30.556
who you would describe as super talented,